  "description": "My younger brother's friend, Yeon-Jun, was just so cute. After he left for America, I completely forgot about him—but a few years later, he suddenly appeared and said, \"You can just eat it and throw it away, so at least try it.\" His unfamiliar tone, his relaxed gaze. He returned as a completely different man.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
